    <briefdescription>
<para>Session state, input data, and visualization configuration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the classes used to represent an FCCVisualization session:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1SessionOptions" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::SessionOptions</ref> stores visualization configuration.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1SessionData" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::SessionData</ref> stores loaded event data.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1Session" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::Session</ref> coordinates the session name, data, options, and access to event information.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Amir H. Ebrahimnezhad <ulink url="mailto:amir.ebh@cern.ch">amir.ebh@cern.ch</ulink></para>
